{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:KnotsParticlesConfinement.ElectroweakTripletBringEmbedding","@type":"LeanModule","name":"KnotsParticlesConfinement.ElectroweakTripletBringEmbedding","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.electroweak_triplet_bring_embedding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.electroweak_triplet_bring_embedding","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/electroweak-triplet-bring-embedding.lean#L59-L70","doc":"**Proposition — electroweak triplet Bring embedding.**\n\nThe three even-twist links `T(2,4), T(2,6), T(2,8)` have Seifert genera\n`1, 2, 3` (L1), *strictly increasing*, all `≤ 4 = g(Σ₄)` (L3); hence\nthey co-embed in the genus-4 Seifert fiber of Bring's surface with the\nsaturating carriers `{T(2,9), T(3,5)}`. Proved sorry-free. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:electroweak-triplet-bring-embedding","label":"prop:electroweak-triplet-bring-embedding","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/electroweak-triplet-bring-embedding.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ew_triplet_embeds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ew_triplet_embeds","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/electroweak-triplet-bring-embedding.lean#L50-L57","doc":"**L3 (embedding).** Each electroweak link has Seifert genus\n`≤ 4 = g(Σ₄)`, hence embeds in the genus-4 Seifert fiber of Bring's\nsurface by the embeddability bound `g(K) ≤ g(Σ₄)`\n(`prop:torus-embeddable-complete`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ew_enumeration","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ew_enumeration","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/electroweak-triplet-bring-embedding.lean#L44-L48","doc":"**L2 (enumeration).** The even-twist 2-component torus links `T(2, 2k)`\nwith Seifert genus in `{1, 2, 3}` are *exactly* `k ∈ {2, 3, 4}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ew_genus_values","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ew_genus_values","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/electroweak-triplet-bring-embedding.lean#L38-L42","doc":"**L1.** The electroweak family `k ∈ {2, 3, 4}` (`T(2,4), T(2,6),\nT(2,8)`) has Seifert genera `1, 2, 3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.bringsGenus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.bringsGenus","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/electroweak-triplet-bring-embedding.lean#L35-L36","doc":"Genus of the Bring surface `Σ₄`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.torusLinkGenus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.torusLinkGenus","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/electroweak-triplet-bring-embedding.lean#L31-L33","doc":"Seifert genus of the even 2-component torus link `T(2, 2k)`: `g = k - 1`.\n(The canonical Seifert surface of `T(2, 2k)` has genus `k - 1`.) ","signatureChunk":0}]}